#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`!tkinter.font` --- Tkinter font wrapper"
msgstr ":mod:`!tkinter.font` --- Tkinter 字体包装器"

#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:7
msgid "**Source code:** :source:`Lib/tkinter/font.py`"
msgstr "**源代码:** :source:`Lib/tkinter/font.py`"

#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:11
msgid ""
"The :mod:`!tkinter.font` module provides the :class:`Font` class for "
"creating and using named fonts."
msgstr ":mod:`!tkinter.font` 模块提供了 :class:`Font` 类，用于创建和使用命名字体。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:14
msgid "The different font weights and slants are:"
msgstr "不同的字体粗细和倾斜是："

#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:23
msgid ""
"The :class:`Font` class represents a named font. *Font* instances are given "
"unique names and can be specified by their family, size, and style "
"configuration. Named fonts are Tk's method of creating and identifying fonts"
" as a single object, rather than specifying a font by its attributes with "
"each occurrence."
msgstr ""
":class:`Font` 类表示命名字体。*Font* 实例具有唯一的名称，可以通过其族、大小和样式配置进行指定。命名字体是 Tk "
"将字体创建和标识为单个对象的方法，而不是通过每次出现时的属性来指定字体。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:29
msgid ""
"Two fonts now compare equal (``==``) only when both are :class:`Font`   "
"instances with the same name belonging to the same Tcl interpreter."
msgstr "现在两个字体相等 (``==``) 的条件是两者都是 :class:`Font` 实例并且具有属于相同 Tcl 解释器的相同名称。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:33
msgid "arguments:"
msgstr "参数："

#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:0
msgid "*font* - font specifier tuple (family, size, options)"
msgstr "*font* - 字体指示符元组 (family, size, options)"

#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:0
msgid "*name* - unique font name"
msgstr "*name* - 唯一的字体名"

#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:0
msgid "*exists* - self points to existing named font if true"
msgstr "*exists* - 指向现有命名字体（如果有）"

#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:39
msgid "additional keyword options (ignored if *font* is specified):"
msgstr "其他关键字选项（如果指定了 *font*，则忽略）："

#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:0
msgid "*family* - font family, for example, Courier, Times"
msgstr "*family* - 实体族，例如 Courier, Times"

#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:0
msgid "*size* - font size"
msgstr "*size* - 字体大小"

#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:0
msgid "If *size* is positive it is interpreted as size in points."
msgstr "如果 *size* 为正数，则解释为以磅为单位的大小。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:0
msgid "If *size* is a negative number its absolute value is treated"
msgstr "如果 *size* 是负数，则将其绝对值"

#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:0
msgid "as size in pixels."
msgstr "解释为以像素为单位的大小。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:0
msgid "*weight* - font emphasis (NORMAL, BOLD)"
msgstr "*weight* - 字体强调 (NORMAL, BOLD)（普通，加粗）"

#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:0
msgid "*slant* - ROMAN, ITALIC"
msgstr "*slant* - ROMAN, ITALIC（正体，斜体）"

#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:0
msgid "*underline* - font underlining (0 - none, 1 - underline)"
msgstr "*underline* - 字体下划线（0 - 无下划线，1 - 有下划线）"

#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:0
msgid "*overstrike* - font strikeout (0 - none, 1 - strikeout)"
msgstr "*overstrike* - 字体删除线（0 - 无删除线，1 - 有删除线）"

#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:53
msgid ""
"Return the actual attributes of the font, which may differ from the "
"requested ones because of platform limitations. With no *option*, return a "
"dictionary of all the attributes; if *option* is given, return the value of "
"that single attribute. The attributes are resolved on the display of the "
"*displayof* widget, or the main application window if it is not specified."
msgstr ""
"返回字体的实际属性，由于平台限制，这些属性可能与请求的属性不同。在没有 *option* 的情况下，返回包含所有属性的字典；如果给定了 *option*"
" ，则返回该单个属性的值。这些属性是在 *displayof* 部件的显示上解析的，如果未指定该部件，则在主应用程序窗口上解析。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:62
msgid "Retrieve an attribute of the font."
msgstr "检索字体的某一个属性值。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:69
msgid ""
"Modify one or more attributes of the font. With no arguments, return a "
"dictionary of the current attributes."
msgstr "修改字体的一个或多个属性。在不带参数的情况下，返回当前属性的字典。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:72
msgid ":meth:`config` is an alias of :meth:`!configure`."
msgstr ":meth:`config` 是 :meth:`!configure` 的别名。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:76
msgid ""
"Return a distinct copy of the current font: a new named font with the same "
"attributes but a different name, which can be reconfigured independently of "
"the original. If the current font wraps a font description, the copy is "
"instead a named font with its resolved attributes."
msgstr ""
"返回当前字体的独立副本：具有相同属性但名称不同的新命名字体，可以独立于原始字体进行重新配置。如果当前字体包装了一个字体描述，则该副本是具有其已解析属性的命名字体。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:84
msgid ""
"Return amount of space the text would occupy on the specified display when "
"formatted in the current font, as an integer number of pixels. If no display"
" is specified then the main application window is assumed."
msgstr "以整数像素数返回使用当前字体排版时文本在指定显示上所占用的空间量。如果未指定显示，则默认使用主应用程序窗口。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:90
msgid ""
"Return font-specific data. With no options, return a dictionary mapping each"
" metric name to its integer value; if one option name is given, return that "
"metric's value as an integer. Options include:"
msgstr ""
"返回字体专属数据。在没有选项的情况下，返回将每个度量名称映射到其整数值的字典；如果给出了一个选项名称，则以整数形式返回该度量的值。选项包括："

#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:96
msgid ""
"*ascent* - distance between baseline and highest point that a character of "
"the font can occupy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:99
msgid ""
"*descent* - distance between baseline and lowest point that a character of "
"the font can occupy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:102
msgid ""
"*linespace* - minimum vertical separation necessary between any two "
"characters of the font that ensures no vertical overlap between lines."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:105
msgid "*fixed* - 1 if font is fixed-width else 0"
msgstr "*fixed* - 如果该字体是等宽字体则为 1，否则为 0。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:109
msgid "Return a tuple of the names of the available font families."
msgstr "返回可用字体系列名称的元组。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:113
msgid "Return a tuple of the names of all the defined fonts."
msgstr "返回所有已定义字体名称的元组。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:117
msgid ""
"Return a :class:`Font` representation of the existing named font *name*. "
"*root* is the widget whose Tcl interpreter owns the font; if omitted, the "
"default root window is used."
msgstr ""
"返回已有命名字体 *name* 的 :class:`Font` 表示形式。 *root* 是其 Tcl "
"解释器拥有该字体的部件；如果省略，则使用默认的根窗口。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:121
msgid "The *root* parameter was added."
msgstr "增加了 *root* 形参。"
